{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:28:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_197f536722ff48ab94d5db94f84c676a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_7bb767a79497261e7693acccbdb0945fa970c7d4369ee76b1af5b27a8de53732","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"paean-ai/deeptide@b48688d56c3e snapshot b47b4daf011a3fc2","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_454f0eec088f1d82dc89144370b49104033e22fcc2f0271faf5ffc61e92d39b0"],"source_ids":["src_494442f144e9507ca69f92e0f116cfbc"],"text":"The product offers 30+ built-in tools (file I/O, shell, web, tasks, MCP, scheduling, sub-agents), 25+ slash commands, and four permission modes: default, accept-edits, plan, and bypass.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:28:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_197f536722ff48ab94d5db94f84c676a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:28:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_197f536722ff48ab94d5db94f84c676a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_857bfcda8b534e951d3bd382dba190f8be110c8190368fa36037245476f53e94","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"paean-ai/deeptide@b48688d56c3e snapshot b47b4daf011a3fc2","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1a4547a3ecde7e7941498971631a9ab15b21c38752f1983e60695c5146b65948","slc_57ba0e917ee1e20b4740bf78970eda1cf29aa6b666c7956816a46c48b3742f48","slc_fced57b81405aa0e7b1ee210cda718fcb71887278b6c4aa2ef6a3e113f6c5c45"],"source_ids":["src_494442f144e9507ca69f92e0f116cfbc"],"text":"The repo hosts two npm packages: `deeptide`, a thin redirect to @paean-ai/zero-cli, and `deeptide-rs`, which ships a native Rust binary via GitHub Releases postinstall; the Rust port lives under crates/.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:28:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_197f536722ff48ab94d5db94f84c676a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:28:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_197f536722ff48ab94d5db94f84c676a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8e8afd0d0185b227560829480e5fd38d291249765313e1a7270d018b7791701b","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"paean-ai/deeptide@b48688d56c3e snapshot b47b4daf011a3fc2","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3d50092cd26fa9582a7cc7967b1f78a910379ad5c7b45038558c7514057f2f5e","slc_7f5e3df721a08a37c795fe960b35fb624ccf457acebb089f496fbf8f46a0fe96"],"source_ids":["src_4f3a3f0b20575ca38dd9b2aeff47c320"],"text":"The local V4 Flash Q2 profile caps context at 64k, disables subagents, and forces serial tool execution, because Q2's attention quality degrades on long contexts and parallel tool calls compound state too quickly.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:28:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_197f536722ff48ab94d5db94f84c676a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:28:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_197f536722ff48ab94d5db94f84c676a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_95bc9a895857b64e8407fb3617264079e97ace343941401fb16e001dd3ca7e22","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"paean-ai/deeptide@b48688d56c3e snapshot b47b4daf011a3fc2","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_454f0eec088f1d82dc89144370b49104033e22fcc2f0271faf5ffc61e92d39b0","slc_8ed34608e75e359b25bd94ed8db22916f58df14cb2fb25e7028068556928f148"],"source_ids":["src_494442f144e9507ca69f92e0f116cfbc"],"text":"DeepTide includes a persistent project memory system across sessions, and GUI and CLI conversations share the same on-disk session store so chats started in either can be resumed in the other.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:28:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_197f536722ff48ab94d5db94f84c676a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:28:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_197f536722ff48ab94d5db94f84c676a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_aa2f60178a1f2bd60e3f20d90c41b240a59054fac10e3a737aa0bee7a8fa7e16","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"paean-ai/deeptide@b48688d56c3e snapshot b47b4daf011a3fc2","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2507d5ce75194a3d186d9ae84d6dda01c578017fe5324047f3504b0df5d7341a","slc_357ec40fd9703fe4129f41be74bd52fc608532fdb59cec17a2cb7743f147fc56","slc_8ed34608e75e359b25bd94ed8db22916f58df14cb2fb25e7028068556928f148","slc_cdc0eda46470a48fa931d0258c8faf09e97948b178afa9ecc5394a39bc546b35"],"source_ids":["src_494442f144e9507ca69f92e0f116cfbc"],"text":"The Rust GUI shares the CLI's configuration (~/.config/tide/settings.json and project .deeptide/settings.json), on-disk session store resumable via `--resume`, and full tool set; it is launched with `deeptide-rs --gui` or the `deeptide-gui` binary.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:28:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_197f536722ff48ab94d5db94f84c676a"}
